00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,800
Everyone packs into Lijiang. Skip it.
I'm your China Travel Expert

2
00:00:02,800 --> 00:00:05,400
A hundred kilometres south sits Shaxi — Lijiang before the crowds.

3
00:00:05,400 --> 00:00:08,000
It was a halt on the thousand-year-old Tea-Horse Road.

4
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:10,600
Caravans swapped Yunnan tea for Tibetan horses here.

5
00:00:10,600 --> 00:00:13,200
The last caravan passed in 1949 — then time just stopped.

6
00:00:13,200 --> 00:00:15,800
Double-tap if you'd pick the quiet town over the crowds.

7
00:00:15,800 --> 00:00:18,800
★ Expert Tip: come on a Friday — Sideng's old square still trades.

8
00:00:18,800 --> 00:00:21,600
Crowded Lijiang or sleepy Shaxi — which are you booking?
